  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Cascade Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> When you use the Cascade Spell metamagic feat, you may spend an additional spell point on the effect. If you do, the maximum caster level for individual magic sphere effects increases by 3 and the combined maximum caster level increases by 6.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may select this feat multiple times, each time you do, you may spend an additional spell point when using Cascade Spell to increase the maximum caster levels by an additional 3 and 6.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting 2: Counters and Control</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/metamagic-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
